WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:16.200
I'm home! Good morning, John, it's January
5th and I'm sitting in my basement back home,

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.590
surrounded by all the things I love.

00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:27.250
I love orange juice. I love Mental Floss magazine
and Benjamin Franklin. Everything is reversed

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:34.380
when I look at it on the computer. I thought
he was over here. I love these old collages

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:39.550
that were on my wall in college that I still
have taped together because I think maybe

00:00:39.550 --> 00:00:47.600
someday I'm gonna put 'em back up on a wall
someday. I love that, right there. You see

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:56.980
it? There. That's a map of the realm of Narnia.
Yeah, it's a map of the realm of Narnia. Hold

00:00:56.980 --> 00:01:02.570
on, I have to go upstairs and get something.

00:01:02.570 --> 00:01:15.200
Movie magic! Lies of omission. What did I
get? We don't actually have Strawberry Hill

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:25.340
here. I didn't know that. I never looked for
it. Until today. Alas, Sutter Home White Zinfandel

00:01:25.340 --> 00:01:26.340
will have to do.

00:01:26.340 --> 00:01:34.420
It's gonna be kind of embarrassing if I have
any of this left in the fridge when friends

00:01:34.420 --> 00:01:41.200
come over, but it's your challenge and you
did stick several pieces of toilet paper in

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:46.600
your mouth and discussed the political situation
in Nepal. I'm glad that I wasn't stuck with

00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:52.100
a political situation in Nepal challenge because
I don't actually know anything about Nepal.

00:01:52.100 --> 00:02:01.140
Except maybe that there's rocks, and that's
only really because there are rocks everywhere.

00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:05.240
A commenter suggested that I drink a glass
of Strawberry Hill wine and then say "Eat

00:02:05.240 --> 00:02:10.149
five sheets of toilet paper while discussing
the political situation in Nepal" really fast

00:02:10.149 --> 00:02:12.750
