00:02:12.750 --> 00:02:20.700
Now there's only one way I'm going to be able
to do that. And that's by eating corn dogs.

00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:25.580
Eating corn dogs is the only way I can chug
an alcoholic beverage without puking. I don't

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:30.140
know why. I think maybe my stomach's just
like, "Oh that corn dog is so good, I can't

00:02:30.140 --> 00:02:34.220
let go of it! I have to hold on to the corn
dog. I don't care how much alcohol you pour

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:39.181
in me, just don't let go of the corn dog!"
I really like corn dogs.

00:02:39.181 --> 00:03:09.150
It's not Strawberry Hill, but it only cost
$3.65. Ugh! Bugligigligah. To brotherhood.

00:03:09.150 --> 00:03:15.130
Eat five sheets of toilet paper while discussing
the political situation in Nepal! HOOAH! That

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:17.260
really wasn't all that hard. What was all
the fuss about?

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:23.230
(singing) Eat five sheets of toilet paper
while discussing the political situation in

00:03:23.230 --> 00:03:23.750
